[
  {
    "id": "F01",
    "family": "negative_parallel",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "这不是勇气，而是坚持。这不是恐惧，而是成长。这不是终点，而是起点。这不是告别，而是开始。这不是选择，而是命运。",
    "reason": "无信息增量的否定转折堆叠。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "5f7cce3348d2f1299909aa887e8d3d067ff288ca3223adaaa48055124ccc53d6"
  },
  {
    "id": "F02",
    "family": "negative_parallel",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "她推开门。并不是风把她带来，是命运替她做了选择。她抬起头。并不是雨让她落泪，是岁月替她诉说。她关上门。并不是夜令她沉默，是时光替她回答。",
    "reason": "同构解释替代现场信息，词形避开既有而是规则。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "96475e327c7694c423fb7aaa5a6bcea10157cb6d64dadb78836a4d808cb2c65f"
  },
  {
    "id": "F03",
    "family": "negative_parallel",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "real_model_excerpt",
    "source": "S2",
    "text": "“不是查无此件。”她抬头看程遥，“是这个编码段从去年三月起就冻结了。这封信在邮政系统里没存在过。”",
    "reason": "否定有新证据，应保留；不评价证据是否足以推出最终结论。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "73d1316bebb4b68d98040bed6cc1f991e24bfe748510837c700fcba65ce38b98"
  },
  {
    "id": "F04",
    "family": "negative_parallel",
    "split": "holdout",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "不是门坏了，而是钥匙拿错了。不是停电，而是保险丝断了。不是人走了，而是灯被挡住了。不是纸丢了，而是夹在账本里。不是锁换了，而是门牌认错了。",
    "reason": "五项独立核验，有对应事实；侦探分析腔。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "侦探分析腔；排除法",
    "originalSha256": "7d7e861f0b1a788b2ae695a06ad737cc73a28d9a351f3ceddc063cd156345f48"
  },
  {
    "id": "F05",
    "family": "dialogue_tail",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "“走吧。”他的语气里带着疲惫。“去哪？”她的语气里带着疑惑。“回家。”他的语气里带着坚定。“现在？”她的语气里带着担忧。“现在。”他的语气里带着决绝。",
    "reason": "每句台词后重复情绪标签。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "95c93e6e0c84148100a83a5d0c7731575246d152d8203228f0d16be76f34e954"
  },
  {
    "id": "F06",
    "family": "dialogue_tail",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "“等我。”他说，话音里的温柔几乎要溢出来。“不等。”她说，话音里的悲伤几乎要溢出来。“求你。”他说，话音里的痛苦几乎要溢出来。",
    "reason": "同构尾注且情绪与台词重复，检测同义变体覆盖。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "1fb4e5455684cc4eeb97fb4c82c240669c8f88e2d2409accb2cce289b01b7dca"
  },
  {
    "id": "F07",
    "family": "dialogue_tail",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "real_model_excerpt",
    "source": "S3",
    "text": "“你欠我的。”程遥的声音追上来。\n\n林砚没回头。“我知道。”",
    "reason": "一句关系冲突后的回应，无密集情绪标注。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "bc36350cc2ab59992dff96228e5914bfe17c117e50abfea2ba7a596f9c562819"
  },
  {
    "id": "F08",
    "family": "dialogue_tail",
    "split": "holdout",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "“线别剪。”他说得很轻，怕门外的人听见。她把剪刀放下，改用指甲挑结。",
    "reason": "轻声有避免被听见的动作目的。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "ddd96d7d938e968a8d76812f6ff0b0c67b1c313d9c4d761072f5ca9abb903f85"
  },
  {
    "id": "F09",
    "family": "body_action",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "他嘴角微微上扬，眼神变得坚定。她嘴角微微上扬，眼神变得坚定。老人嘴角微微上扬，眼神变得坚定。守卫嘴角微微上扬，眼神变得坚定。",
    "reason": "无差异的身体反应替代人物反应。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "add7caf42ef15875060d07d6add95dbc0e8a2c2e122475399777327eb1c95bcd"
  },
  {
    "id": "F10",
    "family": "body_action",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "他把杯子拿起又放下。她把书拿起又放下。老人把钥匙拿起又放下。守卫把帽子拿起又放下。桌上的东西没有换过地方，谁也没有开口。",
    "reason": "换名词复用同一动作，缺少节奏与信息变化；作为可争议代理标签保留。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "ccea96a2fdebddca63fbee559511a349b53ffe5ae841a0a771520b70d1759461"
  },
  {
    "id": "F11",
    "family": "body_action",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "她拿起杯子，发现杯底压着纸条，便放下杯子去开灯。",
    "reason": "拿放动作改变发现的信息。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "25f25bc46ea6858510a04ff8b997e99fd99fe77609797c995c03acd2e5a71ace"
  },
  {
    "id": "F12",
    "family": "body_action",
    "split": "holdout",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "real_model_excerpt",
    "source": "S3",
    "text": "线在她手里。她还有线。",
    "reason": "救援关键载体的短促确认，单独出现不应判高风险。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "e7c02ed4cfcf8c642ba171a7c52e2cf16b234745a36fd51dd389324a687432e6"
  },
  {
    "id": "F13",
    "family": "imagery",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "空气仿佛凝固，时间像是停了下来。空气仿佛凝固，时间像是停了下来。空气仿佛凝固，时间像是停了下来。",
    "reason": "泛化氛围反复替代叙事。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "01b43895de07c0dda63ac363aaf105617ee9a643a690555418b1ddda9663a742"
  },
  {
    "id": "F14",
    "family": "imagery",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "目光像刀子划开夜色，沉默像刀子划开空气，回忆像刀子划开心口，告别像刀子划开岁月。",
    "reason": "同一抽象比喻框架密集套用。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "0808dedb712fb59f117bf24a2dff4cded5e9756e66655a302259a7cca1e0fd6f"
  },
  {
    "id": "F15",
    "family": "imagery",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "real_model_excerpt",
    "source": "S2",
    "text": "线结收尾那个反方向，像一根细刺扎在指腹上。",
    "reason": "修复职业、线结与触觉相关，单次意象有来源。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "42f2a400faa4d7d995889dbe1b9af212b1a721868e1e3119536458c24953e97b"
  },
  {
    "id": "F16",
    "family": "imagery",
    "split": "holdout",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "real_model_excerpt",
    "source": "fast:6",
    "text": "林砚接过信。纸比体温低。",
    "reason": "具体感知，无泛化比喻。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "692c478463ea23cdcd6ad2ff1ab176b7f4b19fd1da2ffb5701c4713d96f81e09"
  },
  {
    "id": "F17",
    "family": "abstract_summary",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "命运的齿轮开始转动。这一刻，他终于明白了成长的意义。命运的齿轮开始转动。这一刻，她终于明白了成长的意义。命运的齿轮开始转动。",
    "reason": "重复抽象总结。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "3bd760eb18d81e3153a6aab7ddfed17e5dcfb2c30ba8b3eaa751688423070975"
  },
  {
    "id": "F18",
    "family": "abstract_summary",
    "split": "holdout",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "他锁好门，所有的等待都有了答案。她收起伞，所有的离别都有了意义。老人放下笔，所有的沉默都有了归宿。",
    "reason": "动作后逐句虚构抽象升华，不提供新信息。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "d02111e6504ee8da34f4adacec771d02c0412f2c635499b1137f0a52d5eadda4"
  },
  {
    "id": "F19",
    "family": "abstract_summary",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "real_model_excerpt",
    "source": "S5",
    "text": "她决定今天不去找。至少今天不去。",
    "reason": "落实当前人物决定与暂缓期限，不应消除这个选择。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "5198edf64e974d638aab9a3bdcea0749925b4bceddc6216b43ee520149f2ca1e"
  },
  {
    "id": "F20",
    "family": "abstract_summary",
    "split": "holdout",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "real_model_excerpt",
    "source": "fast:6",
    "text": "代价：相关记忆永久清除。救援结果：成功。",
    "reason": "作品内记录本条目；形式化不等于模型残留。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "人物记录本，日志文体",
    "originalSha256": "10a5b89c6160a8bc212555e3a6fa6d17838b70e3ce5516682c0bda1d815495e7"
  },
  {
    "id": "F21",
    "family": "rhythm_repetition",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "她把书放回去。她把杯放回去。她把笔放回去。她把伞放回去。她把灯放回去。她把刀放回去。",
    "reason": "短句语法槽位机械复用，不要求逐字完全相同。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "528a8ef120bd8b128bfe03046499298568b9704e6c8f7a9e93acd84aaee7120e"
  },
  {
    "id": "F22",
    "family": "rhythm_repetition",
    "split": "holdout",
    "expectedIntervention": true,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "他看了一眼门。又看了一眼窗。再看了一眼钟。她看了一眼门。又看了一眼窗。再看了一眼钟。",
    "reason": "重复观察而无变化。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "d0701e9273a0f552be1dfeca4b13882626d3baf0311c7c13d3594a47c6da9a76"
  },
  {
    "id": "F23",
    "family": "rhythm_repetition",
    "split": "development",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "real_model_excerpt",
    "source": "S3",
    "text": "铜管深处传来闷响。掌心拍管壁，三快两慢，重复两次。",
    "reason": "信号重复具有验证回应的功能。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
    "originalSha256": "960d0925500abe20e0b7a43e93ed40a8864cd1f9e73a0e5d99fe759bdfa9d136"
  },
  {
    "id": "F24",
    "family": "rhythm_repetition",
    "split": "holdout",
    "expectedIntervention": false,
    "labelAuthority": "agent_editorial_judgment",
    "provenance": "agent_constructed",
    "source": null,
    "text": "她敲了三下。门内响两声。她等到灯灭。钥匙才转动。",
    "reason": "短句但每句推进新事件。",
    "genre": "中文小说",
    "tone": "",
